{
	title: 'Card-colored header metadata',
	spec: 'Web card header metadata (successful exits, counts, durations, limits and hidden-line hints) uses the containing card quiet hue, matching terminal ansi.quiet, instead of the global gray status palette. Preserve nonzero-exit and diff semantic colors. Restore the invariant that metadata inherits its card palette despite sharing the status class with global UI. Terminal already uses card-colored metadata. Hover timing belongs to the separate hover-hint task.',
	status: 'done',
